      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Jun-04-2013 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This matter came on calendar this day for hearing on the Order to Show Cause for Change of Name.<br>Dept. 514, Judge: Donald J. Sullivan, Clerk: S. Vantree, CSR: Sonia Wong, CSR #11288.<br><br>Petitioner Hong Dang was present in pro per, placed under oath and examined.<br><br>Proof of Publication in the file.<br><br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct and sufficient, and that the petition should be granted.<br><br>The Court grants the petition for Change of Name to Anthony Pham.<br><br>Decree Changing Name was submitted to and signed by the Court.<br>",
